          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can adapt your patron's power to transform other creatures into forms more befitting their behavior or your whims. Your familiar learns @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cursed Metamorphosis], even if <em>cursed metamorphosis</em> isn't on your tradition's spell list. By spending 10 minutes in communion with your familiar, you can replace one spell of 6th-rank or higher you've prepared in one of your witch spell slots with a <em>cursed metamorphosis</em> spell of the same rank.</p>"
